WEBVTT

00:03:58.329 --> 00:04:01.496
And you know what you think
is the normal sense now.

00:04:01.496 --> 00:04:04.371
But I found great peace and
thinking of Allah as

00:04:04.371 --> 00:04:08.329
a kind of genderqueer matriarchal
protector,

00:04:08.621 --> 00:04:13.329
sort of like an aquatic being with the
very pronoun they flow through me

00:04:13.329 --> 00:04:16.371
and tell me to embody all the
contradicting subatomic particles

00:04:16.371 --> 00:04:23.329
that make me who I am. I used to think
that I didn't belong in this universe

00:04:23.329 --> 00:04:24.788
because of contradictions,

00:04:25.413 --> 00:04:28.829
contradictions are now the reason I know
I belong firmly in this universe.

00:04:29.579 --> 00:04:33.121
For the next time you find yourself
battling a contradiction of ideas,